  "doc": "The bounds of the world's difficulty settings: for each setting a world can choose, the lowest and the highest value the game accepts. The game keeps a world's own (Custom) settings inside them when it reads the settings at start; the presets (Default, Relaxed, Hard, Survival) keep their own values. Setting names are the server's enshrouded_server.json \"gameSettings\" keys, as Kiln's settings service names them.",
